From 18e597074e91393f9cc13a6bae6e9d785deadfcb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rmuxnet <116457149+rmuxnet@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Jan 2026 16:50:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add .gitignore to exclude __pycache__ directory

Added a .gitignore file to prevent tracking of Python bytecode cache files in the src/__pycache__ directory.
---
 .gitignore | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..786ffc4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+/src/__pycache__
